 "notes": [
  "Both hithpoel (Jer.41.5, 1 form) and hithpolel (5 forms, e.g. 1Kgs.18.28, Deut.14.1) are genuinely attested with the identical \"cut oneself; gather in troops/crowds\" range -- the same kind of paradigm-variant doubling seen repeatedly this session (ענן's poel/polel, געש's hitpael/hithpolel, מהה's hitpael/hithpalpel). Included both, matching the request's own \"Hithpo(lel)\" notation flagging the ambiguity."
